 /*********************************************************************/
 /* Program     : COBSWAIT.PLI                                        */
 /* Application : CardDemo                                            */
 /* Type        : Batch PL/I Utility Program                          */
 /* Function    : Wait/delay utility for batch job scheduling         */
 /* Converted from COBOL batch: app/cbl/COBSWAIT.cbl                 */
